    <string name="privacy_title">Help &amp; privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_lead">Your steps never leave this phone.</string>
    <string name="privacy_p1">Step Skyscraper reads one thing: your daily step count, from Health Connect (or your phone\'s step counter if Health Connect isn\'t available). It never reads location, heart rate, sleep or workouts.</string>
    <string name="privacy_p2">Steps, floors, towers and achievements are stored only on this phone and included in your Android backup. There is no account and no server.</string>
    <string name="privacy_p3">We use anonymous product analytics and crash reports (Firebase) to improve the app. They never contain step counts, floors or any health data.</string>
    <string name="privacy_p4">One optional rewarded ad on the Skyline tab is served by Google AdMob after you make a privacy choice. Ads never receive step data.</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy">Read the full privacy policy</string>
